      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Imlaystown%2C_New_Jersey"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Ye Olde Yellow Meeting House, built in 1737, is one of the oldest surviving structures in the area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
