      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Imlaystown%2C_New_Jersey"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Imlaystown’s post office operated from 1832 until its closure in 2009, marking over 170 years of service.",
